  <div class=\"status-cell\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"amount status cell\">\n                            <span class=\"status-label\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"amount status label\">\n                                Amount\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"status-content amount-copy\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"amount status content\">\n                                $0.00 proposed · not payable yet\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </header>\n                <div class=\"convo-toolbar\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"conversation toolbar\">\n                    <h3 class=\"section-title\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"conversation section title\">\n                        Conversation\n                    </h3>\n                    <div aria-label=\"Conversation scope\" class=\"thread-filter\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"thread scope filter\">\n                        <button class=\"active\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"whole thread filter button (active)\" type=\"button\">\n                            Whole thread\n                        </button>\n                        <button data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"this case filter button\" type=\"button\">\n                            This case\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"thread-body\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3\" data-name=\"conversation thread body\">\n                    <span class=\"thread-date\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"thread date divider\">\n                        7 October\n                    </span>\n                    <article class=\"turn\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-2\" data-name=\"customer message turn\">\n                        <div class=\"turn-header\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"turn sender header\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-user-round\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"customer avatar icon\">\n                            </i>\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"sender role label\">\n                                Customer\n                            </span>\n                            <time data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-2-1-3\" data-name=\"message timestamp\">\n                                17:12\n                            </time>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"turn-copy\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"customer message text\">\n                            “i have a problem with my order”\n                        </p>\n                    </article>\n                    <article class=\"turn assistant\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-3\" data-name=\"assistant message turn\">\n                        <div class=\"turn-header\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"turn sender header\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-message-square\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-3-1-1\" data-name=\"assistant avatar icon\">\n                            </i>\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-3-1-2\" data-name=\"sender role label\">\n                                Assistant asked\n                            </span>\n                            <time data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-3-1-3\" data-name=\"message timestamp\">\n                                17:12\n                            </time>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"assistant-copy-label\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-3-2\" data-name=\"assistant intent label\">\n                            Clarifying question · not a decision\n                        </span>\n                        <p class=\"turn-copy\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-3-3\" data-name=\"assistant message text\">\n                            “Just so I check this properly - what has gone wrong with it? For example something broken, something different from what you ordered, a delivery problem, or a charge you did not expect.”\n                        </p>\n                    </article>\n                    <article class=\"turn\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-4\" data-name=\"customer message turn\">\n                        <div class=\"turn-header\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-4-1\" data-name=\"turn sender header\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-user-round\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-4-1-1\" data-name=\"customer avatar icon\">\n                            </i>\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-4-1-2\" data-name=\"sender role label\">\n                                Customer\n                            </span>\n                            <time data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-4-1-3\" data-name=\"message timestamp\">\n                                17:12\n                            </time>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"turn-copy\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-4-2\" data-name=\"customer message text\">\n                            “it is different from what was described, it is blue i ordered for the red one”\n                        </p>\n                    </article>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"reply-slot\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-4\" data-name=\"reply composer slot\">\n                    <div class=\"reply-guidance\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-4-1\" data-name=\"reply guidance note\">\n                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-info\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"info icon\">\n                        </i>\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"reply guidance text\">\n                            Take over this conversation to reply. The reply composer stays here after takeover.\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <form aria-label=\"Reply to customer\" class=\"reply-form\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-4-2\" data-name=\"reply form\">\n                        <input aria-label=\"Reply to Sam Okonkwo\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"reply text input (disabled)\" disabled=\"\" placeholder=\"Reply to Sam Okonkwo…\" type=\"text\"/>\n                        <button aria-label=\"Attach a photo\" class=\"attach-button\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"attach photo button (disabled)\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-paperclip\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"paperclip icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </button>\n                        <button aria-label=\"Send reply\" class=\"reply-send\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-4-2-3\" data-name=\"send reply button (disabled)\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-send\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-4-2-3-1\" data-name=\"send icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </button>\n                    </form>\n                    <p class=\"reply-disabled-note\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-4-3\" data-name=\"reply disabled note\">\n                        This case is waiting for an agent to take over. No reply has been sent.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n            <aside aria-label=\"Case record\" class=\"record\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3\" data-name=\"case record sidebar\">\n                <header class=\"record-head\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"case record header\">\n                    <h2 class=\"record-title\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-1-1\" data-name=\"case record title\">\n                        Case record\n                    </h2>\n                    <a class=\"record-title-link\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-1-2\" data-name=\"open request history link\" href=\"#request-history\">\n                        Open request history ↗\n                    </a>\n                </header>\n                <div class=\"record-scroll\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2\" data-name=\"case record scrollable body\">\n                    <section class=\"record-section\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-1\" data-name=\"customer words section\" id=\"customer-words\">\n                        <h3 data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"customer words section heading\">\n                            Customer said\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"record-quote\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"customer quote\">\n                            “it is different from what was described, it is blue i ordered for the red one”\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"record-assistant\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-1-3\" data-name=\"assistant question note\">\n                            Assistant asked: “Just so I check this properly - what has gone wrong with it? For example something broken, something different from what you ordered, a delivery problem, or a charge you did not expect.”\n                        </p>\n                    </section>\n                    <section class=\"record-section\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-2\" data-name=\"evidence section\" id=\"evidence\">\n                        <h3 data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"evidence section heading\">\n                            Evidence checked\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"no-evidence\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"no evidence message\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-circle-help\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"help circle icon\">\n                            </i>\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"no evidence text\">\n                                Nothing was verified against the customer’s own words.\n                            </span>\n                        </p>\n                    </section>\n                    <section class=\"record-section\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-3\" data-name=\"assistant claim section\" id=\"claim\">\n                        <h3 data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"assistant claim section heading\">\n                            Assistant claim\n                        </h3>\n                        <dl class=\"claim-rows\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-3-2\" data-name=\"claim definition list\">\n                            <dt data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"decision claim label\">\n                                Decision\n                            </dt>\n                            <dd data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"decision value cell\">\n                                <span class=\"decision-mark\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"escalated decision badge\">\n                                    Escalated\n                                </span>\n                            </dd>\n                            <dt data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-3-2-3\" data-name=\"amount claim label\">\n                                Amount\n                            </dt>\n                            <dd data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-3-2-4\" data-name=\"amount claim value\">\n                                $0.00 proposed, not payable yet\n                            </dd>\n                            <dt data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-3-2-5\" data-name=\"summary claim label\">\n                                Summary\n                            </dt>\n                            <dd data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-3-2-6\" data-name=\"summary claim value\">\n                                Escalated for human review. No policy rule reached a conclusion.\n                            </dd>\n                        </dl>\n                    </section>\n                    <section class=\"record-section\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-4\" data-name=\"policy outcome section\" id=\"policy-trace\">\n                        <h3 data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-4-1\" data-name=\"policy outcome section heading\">\n                            Policy outcome\n                        </h3>\n                        <p data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-4-2\" data-name=\"policy outcome description\">\n                            No rule concluded on this request, so it was sent to a person. The assistant’s claim is not authorization to pay.\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"policy-summary\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-4-3\" data-name=\"policy escalation warning box\">\n                            <strong data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-4-3-1\" data-name=\"warning title\">\n                                Escalation is not a refund approval.\n                            </strong>\n                            Payment remains unapproved until policy allows it and a staff member verifies it.\n                        </div>\n                        <a class=\"rule-link\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-4-4\" data-name=\"full rule trace link\" href=\"#request-history\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-file-text\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-4-4-1\" data-name=\"file text icon\">\n                            </i>\n                            Read the full rule trace in request history\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-arrow-up-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-4-4-2\" data-name=\"external link arrow icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </a>\n                    </section>\n                    <section class=\"record-section\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-5\" data-name=\"case context section\" id=\"case-context\">\n                        <h3 data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-5-1\" data-name=\"case context section heading\">\n                            Case context\n                        </h3>\n                        <div class=\"record-facts\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-5-2\" data-name=\"case facts list\">\n                            <div class=\"record-fact\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-5-2-1\" data-name=\"customer fact row\">\n                                <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-5-2-1-1\" data-name=\"customer fact label\">\n                                    Customer\n                                </span>\n                                <strong data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-5-2-1-2\" data-name=\"customer fact value\">\n                                    Sam Okonkwo\n                                </strong>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"record-fact\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-5-2-2\" data-name=\"order fact row\">\n                                <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-5-2-2-1\" data-name=\"order fact label\">\n                                    Order\n                                </span>\n                                <strong class=\"mono\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-5-2-2-2\" data-name=\"order fact value\">\n                                    …90b3-b5208acefe4f\n                                </strong>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"record-fact\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-5-2-3\" data-name=\"messages fact row\">\n                                <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-5-2-3-1\" data-name=\"messages fact label\">\n                                    Messages\n                                </span>\n                                <strong data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-5-2-3-2\" data-name=\"messages fact value\">\n                                    2 customer messages\n                                </strong>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"record-fact\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-5-2-4\" data-name=\"case scope fact row\">\n                                <span data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-5-2-4-1\" data-name=\"case scope fact label\">\n                                    Case scope\n                                </span>\n                                <strong data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-5-2-4-2\" data-name=\"case scope fact value\">\n                                    1 item\n                                </strong>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"footer-note\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-3-2-5-3\" data-name=\"section footer note\">\n                            The written policy makes the refund decision. A person handles this escalation.\n                        </p>\n                    </section>\n                </div>\n            </aside>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n</div>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-10-07T18:48:27.914922+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-10-07T18:56:36.611675+00:00",
      "id": "var_2c9ca7eb4fca",
      "contentHeight": 1000
    },
    "var_8cf11b9530bf": {
      "type": "variant",
      "label": "Next Safe Action — Shopper Help",
      "parentId": null,
      "themeId": null,
      "rect": {
        "x": 1540,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 1440,
        "h": 0
      },
      "html": "<style>\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fira+Code:wght@400;500;600&family=Fira+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');\n@import url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/lucide-static@1.48.0/font/lucide.css');\n@layer base {\n  body { margin: 0; background: #f7f5f2; color: #1c1917; font-family: 'Fira Sans', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }\n}\n@layer components {\n  .support-app { --ink:#1c1917; --ink-soft:#57534e; --ink-faint:#78716c; --page:#f7f5f2; --surface:#fffdfa; --surface-soft:#f3f1ed; --line:#e7e2da; --line-strong:#d6cec3; --brand:#e85d04; --brand-deep:#c94800; --brand-soft:#fff0e5; --ok:#087443; --ok-soft:#eaf8f0; --font-mono:'Fira Code',ui-monospace,monospace; min-height:100vh; background:var(--page); color:var(--ink); }\n  .shop-topbar { display:grid; grid-template-columns:auto minmax(190px, 1fr) auto; align-items:center; gap:28px; min-height:72px; padding:0 max(32px, calc((100vw - 1320px) / 2)); background:var(--surface); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }\n  .shop-brand { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:11px; color:var(--ink); text-decoration:none; font-size:16px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:-.02em; white-space:nowrap; }\n  .brand-mark { display:grid; width:38px; height:38px; place-items:center; border-radius:11px; background:var(--brand); color:white; font-size:17px; font-weight:700; }\n  .brand-copy small { display:block; margin-top:1px; color:var(--ink-faint); font-size:12px; font-weight:400; letter-spacing:0; }\n  .shop-search { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; width:min(100%,460px); min-height:42px; padding:0 13px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:9px; background:var(--page); color:var(--ink-faint); }\n  .shop-search i { font-size:17px; color:var(--ink-soft); }\n  .shop-search span { font-size:14px; }\n  .shop-nav { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:4px; }\n  .nav-link { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:7px; min-height:42px; padding:0 10px; border-radius:7px; color:var(--ink-soft); text-decoration:none; font-size:14px; font-weight:600; white-space:nowrap; }\n  .nav-link i { font-size:17px; }\n  .nav-link.current { color:var(--brand-deep); background:var(--brand-soft); }\n  .cart-count { display:grid; min-width:19px; height:19px; place-items:center; border-radius:50%; color:white; background:var(--brand); font-size:12px; }\n  .help-main { width:min(1280px, calc(100% - 64px)); margin:0 auto; padding:30px 0 36px; }\n  .help-heading { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:24px; margin-bottom:22px; }\n  .help-heading h1 { margin:0; font-size:30px; line-height:1.16; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:-.035em; }\n  .mode-switch { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:3px; padding:4px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:10px; background:var(--surface); }\n  .mode-button { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:8px; min-height:40px; padding:0 14px; border:1px solid transparent; border-radius:7px; background:transparent; color:var(--ink-soft); font:600 14px/1.2 'Fira Sans',sans-serif; }\n  .mode-button i { font-size:16px; }\n  .mode-button.active { background:var(--brand-soft); border-color:#ffd3b5; color:var(--brand-deep); }\n  .help-workspace { display:grid; grid-template-columns:320px minmax(0,1fr); gap:24px; align-items:stretch; }\n  .order-aside { display:flex; flex-direction:column; min-width:0; padding:20px; background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:12px; }\n  .order-aside h2 { margin:0 0 15px; font-size:18px; line-height:1.3; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:-.02em; }\n  .order-select-label { display:block; margin-bottom:7px; color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:13px; font-weight:600; }\n  .order-select { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:10px; min-height:44px; padding:0 11px; border:1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius:7px; color:var(--ink); background:white; font-size:14px; font-weight:600; }\n  .order-select i { color:var(--ink-faint); font-size:16px; }\n  .order-facts { display:grid; grid-template-columns:auto 1fr; gap:8px 12px; margin:14px 0 0; font-size:14px; }\n  .order-facts dt { color:var(--ink-faint); }\n  .order-facts dd { margin:0; color:var(--ink); font-weight:500; }\n  .delivery-status { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; color:var(--ok); font-weight:600; text-transform:capitalize; }\n  .delivery-status i { font-size:15px; }\n  .item-line { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto; gap:8px; align-items:center; margin-top:19px; padding:15px 0 13px; border-top:1px solid var(--line); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }\n  .item-name { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; min-width:0; font-size:14px; font-weight:600; }\n  .item-name i { display:grid; flex:none; width:32px; height:32px; place-items:center; border-radius:7px; background:var(--surface-soft); color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:17px; }\n  .item-qty { display:block; color:var(--ink-faint); font-size:13px; font-weight:400; }\n  .item-price { white-space:nowrap; font-size:14px; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; }\n  .total-row { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:12px; padding-top:13px; color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:14px; }\n  .total-row strong { color:var(--ink); font-size:16px; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; }\n  .policy-note { display:flex; gap:10px; margin-top:auto; padding-top:18px; color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:13px; line-height:1.5; }\n  .policy-note i { flex:none; margin-top:2px; color:var(--brand-deep); font-size:17px; }\n  .policy-note strong { color:var(--ink); font-weight:600; }\n  .conversation { display:flex; flex-direction:column; min-width:0; min-height:650px; overflow:hidden; background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:12px; }\n  .conversation-head { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:20px; padding:19px 24px 17px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }\n  .conversation-head h2 { margin:0; font-size:19px; line-height:1.3; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:-.02em; }\n  .conversation-head p { margin:4px 0 0; color:var(--ink-faint); font-size:13px; }\n  .conversation-head p strong { color:var(--ink-soft); font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:12px; font-weight:500; }\n  .next-action { display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:10px; margin:18px 24px 0; padding:12px 14px; border-radius:7px; background:var(--surface-soft); color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:14px; line-height:1.45; }\n  .next-action i { flex:none; margin-top:1px; color:var(--brand-deep); font-size:17px; }\n  .next-action strong { color:var(--ink); font-weight:600; }\n  .thread-body { display:flex; flex:1; flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-start; padding:20px 24px 18px; }\n  .assistant-message { max-width:68ch; padding:13px 15px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:8px 8px 8px 2px; background:#f8f7f4; color:var(--ink); font-size:15px; line-height:1.55; }\n  .message-author { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:7px; margin-bottom:5px; color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:13px; font-weight:600; }\n  .message-author i { font-size:15px; }\n  .starter-heading { margin:20px 0 4px; color:var(--ink); font-size:14px; font-weight:600; }\n  .starter-caption { margin:0 0 12px; color:var(--ink-faint); font-size:13px; }\n  .starter-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:8px; width:min(100%,700px); }\n  .starter-choice { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:10px; min-height:44px; padding:9px 12px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:7px; background:white; color:var(--ink); text-align:left; font:500 14px/1.3 'Fira Sans',sans-serif; }\n  .starter-choice i { flex:none; color:var(--ink-faint); font-size:15px; }\n  .starter-choice:hover { border-color:var(--line-strong); background:var(--surface-soft); }\n  .compose-area { padding:14px 24px 18px; border-top:1px solid var(--line); background:var(--surface); }\n  .compose-label { display:block; margin-bottom:6px; color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:13px; font-weight:600; }\n  .compose-row { display:flex; align-items:stretch; gap:9px; }\n  .compose-input { flex:1; min-width:0; min-height:46px; padding:11px 13px; border:1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius:8px; background:white; color:var(--ink); font:400 14px 'Fira Sans',sans-serif; }\n  .compose-input::placeholder { color:var(--ink-faint); }\n  .send-button { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:8px; min-width:100px; min-height:46px; padding:0 16px; border:1px solid var(--brand); border-radius:8px; background:var(--brand); color:white; font:600 14px 'Fira Sans',sans-serif; }\n  .send-button i { font-size:16px; }\n  .send-button:hover { background:var(--brand-deep); }\n  .compose-footnote { margin:7px 0 0; color:var(--ink-faint); font-size:12px; }\n  @media (max-width: 1050px) {\n    .shop-topbar { grid-template-columns:auto minmax(150px,1fr); gap:14px; padding:10px 24px; }\n    .shop-nav { grid-column:1/-1; justify-content:flex-start; }\n    .help-main { width:min(100% - 48px, 900px); }\n    .help-workspace { grid-template-columns:280px minmax(0,1fr); gap:16px; }\n    .order-aside { padding:17px; }\n    .conversation-head,.thread-body { padding-left:18px; padding-right:18px; }\n    .next-action { margin-left:18px; margin-right:18px; }\n    .compose-area { padding-left:18px; padding-right:18px; }\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 760px) {\n    .shop-topbar { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:10px; padding:11px 16px 0; }\n    .shop-brand { grid-row:1; }\n    .shop-search { display:none; }\n    .shop-nav { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr)); grid-column:auto; width:100%; gap:2px; padding-top:5px; border-top:1px solid var(--line); }\n    .nav-link { flex-direction:column; justify-content:center; gap:1px; min-height:52px; padding:4px 2px; font-size:12px; }\n    .nav-link i { font-size:17px; }\n    .cart-count { position:absolute; margin:0 0 25px 24px; min-width:16px; height:16px; font-size:10px; }\n    .help-main { width:calc(100% - 32px); padding:22px 0 24px; }\n    .help-heading { align-items:flex-start; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin-bottom:15px; }\n    .help-heading h1 { font-size:25px; }\n    .mode-switch { width:100%; }\n    .mode-button { flex:1; }\n    .help-workspace { grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr); gap:12px; }\n    .order-aside { padding:15px; }\n    .order-aside h2 { margin-bottom:10px; font-size:16px; }\n    .order-facts { grid-template-columns:auto 1fr auto 1fr; gap:6px 8px; font-size:13px; }\n    .item-line { margin-top:12px; padding:10px 0; }\n    .policy-note { margin-top:13px; padding-top:12px; border-top:1px solid var(--line); font-size:13px; }\n    .conversation { min-height:600px; }\n    .conversation-head { padding:15px 15px 13px; }\n    .conversation-head h2 { font-size:17px; }\n    .next-action { margin:12px 15px 0; padding:10px 11px; font-size:13px; }\n    .thread-body { padding:15px; }\n    .assistant-message { max-width:100%; font-size:14px; }\n    .starter-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:7px; }\n    .starter-choice { min-height:44px; }\n    .compose-area { padding:12px 15px 14px; }\n    .compose-row { gap:7px; }\n    .send-button { min-width:48px; padding:0 13px; }\n    .send-label { display:none; }\n  }\n}\n</style>\n<div class=\"support-app\" data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"refund help support page container\">\n    <header class=\"shop-topbar\" data-kid=\"1-1\" data-name=\"shop top navigation bar\">\n        <a aria-label=\"Refund Store home\" class=\"shop-brand\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\" data-name=\"store brand link with logo\" href=\"#shop\">\n            <span class=\"brand-mark\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"store brand monogram badge\">\n                R\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"brand-copy\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"store brand name text\">\n                Refund Store\n                <small data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"store tagline text\">\n                    everyday finds, clearly handled\n                </small>\n            </span>\n        </a>\n        <div class=\"shop-search\" data-kid=\"1-1-2\" data-name=\"product search field\" role=\"search\">\n            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-search\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"search magnifying glass icon\">\n            </i>\n            <span data-kid=\"1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"search placeholder text\">\n                What are you looking for?\n            </span>\n        </div>\n        <nav aria-label=\"Shop navigation\" class=\"shop-nav\" data-kid=\"1-1-3\" data-name=\"main shop navigation\">\n            <a class=\"nav-link\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"shop navigation link with bag icon\" href=\"#shop\">\n                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-shopping-bag\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"shopping bag icon\">\n                </i>\n                <span data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"Shop navigation label\">\n                    Shop\n                </span>\n            </a>\n            <a class=\"nav-link\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2\" data-name=\"orders navigation link with package icon\" href=\"#orders\">\n                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-package\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"package box icon\">\n                </i>\n                <span data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"Orders navigation label\">\n                    Orders\n                </span>\n            </a>\n            <a aria-current=\"page\" class=\"nav-link current\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-3\" data-name=\"help navigation current page link\" href=\"#help\">\n                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-message-square\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-3-1\" data-name=\"message square chat icon\">\n                </i>\n                <span data-kid=\"1-1-3-3-2\" data-name=\"Help navigation label\">\n                    Help\n                </span>\n            </a>\n            <a class=\"nav-link\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4\" data-name=\"account navigation link with user icon\" href=\"#account\">\n                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-user-round\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-1\" data-name=\"account user icon\">\n                </i>\n                <span data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-2\" data-name=\"Account navigation label\">\n                    Account\n                </span>\n            </a>\n            <a class=\"nav-link\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-5\" data-name=\"cart navigation link with cart icon\" href=\"#cart\">\n                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-shopping-cart\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-5-1\" data-name=\"shopping cart icon\">\n                </i>\n                <span data-kid=\"1-1-3-5-2\" data-name=\"Cart navigation label\">\n                    Cart\n                </span>\n            </a>\n        </nav>\n    </header>\n    <main class=\"help-main\" data-kid=\"1-2\" data-name=\"help page main content\">\n        <div class=\"help-heading\" data-kid=\"1-2-1\" data-name=\"help page heading row\">\n            <h1 data-kid=\"1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"help page title heading\">\n                Get help with an order\n            </h1>\n            <div aria-label=\"Help mode\" class=\"mode-switch\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"help mode switcher group\" role=\"group\">\n                <button aria-pressed=\"true\" class=\"mode-button active\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"active refund help mode button\" type=\"button\">\n                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-message-circle\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"refund help chat bubble icon\">\n                    </i>\n                    Refund help\n                </button>\n                <button aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"mode-button\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"shopping help mode button\" type=\"button\">\n                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-shopping-bag\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"shopping help bag icon\">\n                    </i>\n                    Shopping help\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"help-workspace\" data-kid=\"1-2-2\" data-name=\"help workspace two-column layout\">\n            <aside aria-label=\"Selected order\" class=\"order-aside\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"selected order aside panel\">\n                <h2 data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"order details heading\">\n                    About this order\n                </h2>\n                <span class=\"order-select-label\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"selected order field label\">\n                    Selected order\n                </span>\n                <div class=\"order-select\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-3\" data-name=\"order selection dropdown\">\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"order ID value\">\n                        ORD-DEMO-02\n                    </span>\n                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-chevron-down\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-3-2\" data-name=\"dropdown chevron down icon\">\n                    </i>\n                </div>\n                <dl class=\"order-facts\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-4\" data-name=\"order facts definition list\">\n                    <dt data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-4-1\" data-name=\"order placed date label\">\n                        Placed\n                    </dt>\n                    <dd data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-4-2\" data-name=\"order placed date value\">\n                        27/09/2026\n                    </dd>\n                    <dt data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-4-3\" data-name=\"delivery status label\">\n                        Delivery\n                    </dt>\n                    <dd data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-4-4\" data-name=\"delivery status value\">\n                        <span class=\"delivery-status\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-4-4-1\" data-name=\"delivered status badge with check icon\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-circle-check\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-4-4-1-1\" data-name=\"circle checkmark status icon\">\n                            </i>\n                            Delivered\n                        </span>\n                    </dd>\n                    <dt data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-4-5\" data-name=\"payment status label\">\n                        Payment\n                    </dt>\n                    <dd data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-4-6\" data-name=\"payment settled value\">\n                        Settled\n                    </dd>\n                </dl>\n                <div class=\"item-line\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-5\" data-name=\"order item line\">\n                    <div class=\"item-name\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-5-1\" data-name=\"order item name with icon\">\n                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-lamp\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-5-1-1\" data-name=\"item lamp icon\">\n                        </i>\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-5-1-2\" data-name=\"order item name text\">\n                            Aurora Desk Lamp\n                            <span class=\"item-qty\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-5-1-2-1\" data-name=\"item quantity text\">\n                                Quantity 1\n                            </span>\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"item-price\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-5-2\" data-name=\"item price value\">\n                        $129.00\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"total-row\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-6\" data-name=\"order total paid row\">\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-6-1\" data-name=\"total paid label\">\n                        Total paid\n                    </span>\n                    <strong data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-6-2\" data-name=\"total paid amount\">\n                        $129.00\n                    </strong>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"policy-note\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-7\" data-name=\"refund policy note\">\n                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-shield-check\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-7-1\" data-name=\"shield check protection icon\">\n                    </i>\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-7-2\" data-name=\"policy note body text\">\n                        <strong data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-7-2-1\" data-name=\"policy note emphasized lead sentence\">\n                            Refund decisions follow the written policy.\n                        </strong>\n                        The assistant reads your message and can ask for details; a person checks any decision involving money.\n                    </span>\n                </p>\n            </aside>\n            <section aria-label=\"Refund help conversation\" class=\"conversation\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"refund help conversation panel\">\n                <header class=\"conversation-head\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"conversation panel header\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"conversation header title block\">\n                        <h2 data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"conversation panel title\">\n                            Refund help\n                        </h2>\n                        <p data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"conversation order context subtitle\">\n                            For\n                            <strong data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"context order ID in mono\">\n                                ORD-DEMO-02\n                            </strong>\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </header>\n                <p class=\"next-action\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"next action instruction banner\">\n                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-arrow-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"right arrow instruction icon\">\n                    </i>\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"next action instruction text\">\n                        <strong data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"instruction emphasized lead\">\n                            Your turn:\n                        </strong>\n                        choose a reason or describe what happened. The assistant reads your message; the written policy determines what is allowed.\n                    </span>\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"thread-body\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"conversation thread body\">\n                    <div class=\"assistant-message\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"assistant message bubble\">\n                        <div class=\"message-author\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"assistant message author row\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-message-circle\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"assistant chat bubble icon\">\n                            </i>\n                            Assistant\n                        </div>\n                        Tell me what went wrong with this order and I’ll check what the refund policy allows.\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 class=\"starter-heading\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"starter options section heading\">\n                        Choose a starting point\n                    </h3>\n                    <p class=\"starter-caption\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-3\" data-name=\"starter options draft caption\">\n                        These are drafts. You can edit your message before sending.\n                    </p>\n                    <div aria-label=\"Common reasons\" class=\"starter-grid\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-4\" data-name=\"common reason starter buttons grid\">\n                        <button class=\"starter-choice\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-4-1\" data-name=\"arrived damaged starter reason button\" type=\"button\">\n                            Arrived damaged\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-arrow-up-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-4-1-1\" data-name=\"up-right direction arrow icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"starter-choice\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-4-2\" data-name=\"wrong item sent starter reason button\" type=\"button\">\n                            Wrong item sent\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-arrow-up-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-4-2-1\" data-name=\"up-right direction arrow icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"starter-choice\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-4-3\" data-name=\"not as described starter reason button\" type=\"button\">\n                            Not as described\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-arrow-up-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-4-3-1\" data-name=\"up-right direction arrow icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"starter-choice\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-4-4\" data-name=\"late delivery starter reason button\" type=\"button\">\n                            Late delivery\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-arrow-up-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-4-4-1\" data-name=\"up-right direction arrow icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"starter-choice\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-4-5\" data-name=\"missing from box starter reason button\" type=\"button\">\n                            Missing from the box\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-arrow-up-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-4-5-1\" data-name=\"up-right direction arrow icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"starter-choice\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-4-6\" data-name=\"charged twice starter reason button\" type=\"button\">\n                            Charged twice\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-arrow-up-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-4-6-1\" data-name=\"up-right direction arrow icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"starter-choice\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-4-7\" data-name=\"want to return it starter reason button\" type=\"button\">\n                            I want to return it\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-arrow-up-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-4-7-1\" data-name=\"up-right direction arrow icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"starter-choice\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-4-8\" data-name=\"something else starter reason button\" type=\"button\">\n                            Something else\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-arrow-up-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-4-8-1\" data-name=\"up-right direction arrow icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <form class=\"compose-area\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4\" data-name=\"message compose form area\">\n                    <label class=\"compose-label\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"message input field label\" for=\"message\">\n                        Your message\n                    </label>\n                    <div class=\"compose-row\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-2\" data-name=\"message input and send row\">\n                        <input class=\"compose-input\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"user message text input field\" id=\"message\" placeholder=\"Describe what went wrong…\" type=\"text\"/>\n                        <button class=\"send-button\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"send message button\" type=\"button\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-send\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"send paper airplane icon\">\n                            </i>\n                            <span class=\"send-label\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-2-2-2\" data-name=\"send button text label\">\n                                Send\n                            </span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"compose-footnote\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-3\" data-name=\"policy check footnote text\">\n                        Your message will be checked against the written refund policy.\n                    </p>\n                </form>\n            </section>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n</div>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-10-07T18:48:37.209680+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-10-07T18:49:11.426311+00:00",
      "id": "var_8cf11b9530bf",
      "contentHeight": 1000
    },
    "var_4e0b6e94f0fd": {
      "type": "variant",
      "label": "Follow the Boundary — Shopper Help",
      "parentId": null,
      "themeId": null,
      "rect": {
        "x": 3080,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 1440,
        "h": 0
      },
      "html": "<style>\n    @import url(\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fira+Code:wght@400;500;600&family=Fira+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap\");\n@import url(\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/lucide-static@1.48.0/font/lucide.css\");\n.scene{--ink:#1c1917;--ink-soft:#57534e;--ink-faint:#6b625a;--page:#f7f5f2;--surface:#fffdfa;--surface-soft:#f3f1ed;--line:#e7e2da;--line-strong:#d6cec3;--brand:#e85d04;--brand-deep:#c94800;--brand-soft:#fff0e5;--ok:#087443;--ok-soft:#eaf8f0;min-height:100vh;background:var(--page);color:var(--ink);font:16px/1.5 'Fira Sans',Arial,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}\n.scene *{box-sizing:border-box}.scene h1,.scene h2,.scene h3,.scene p{margin:0}.scene button,.scene input,.scene textarea{font:inherit}.scene button{cursor:pointer}.scene a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.scene .icon{display:inline-block;width:18px;height:18px;color:currentColor;font-size:18px;line-height:1;flex:none}\n.shopbar{min-height:76px;background:var(--surface);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.shopbar-inner{width:min(1344px,calc(100% - 64px));min-height:76px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:28px}.brand{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;min-width:max-content;color:var(--ink);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.15}.brand-mark{display:grid;width:40px;height:40px;place-items:center;border-radius:12px;background:var(--brand);color:#fff;font-size:18px;font-weight:700}.brand-copy small{display:block;margin-top:4px;color:var(--ink-faint);font-size:13px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0}.shop-search{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex:1;max-width:380px;min-width:140px;height:44px;padding:0 14px;color:var(--ink-faint);background:var(--surface-soft);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px}.shop-search span{font-size:14px}.main-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;margin-left:auto}.nav-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:44px;padding:0 12px;border-radius:8px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:15px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap}.nav-link.active{background:var(--brand-soft);color:var(--brand-deep)}.cart-count{display:inline-grid;min-width:19px;height:19px;place-items:center;border-radius:99px;background:#ece8e2;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:12px;font-weight:700}\n.shell{width:min(1280px,calc(100% - 64px));margin:0 auto;padding:32px 0 40px}.page-heading{margin-bottom:24px}.page-heading h1{font-size:32px;line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-.025em;font-weight:700}.page-heading p{max-width:58ch;margin-top:9px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:16px}.workspace{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(295px,340px) minmax(0,1fr);gap:24px;align-items:stretch}\n.order-panel{align-self:start;padding:20px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px}.mode-toggle{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:4px;padding:4px;background:#f0ede8;border-radius:8px}.mode-button{min-height:42px;padding:0 10px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:6px;background:transparent;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:14px;font-weight:600}.mode-button.selected{background:var(--surface);border-color:var(--line);color:var(--ink);box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgb(28 25 23 / 6%)}.order-details{margin-top:24px}.order-details h2{font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:700}.order-id{margin-top:8px;font:500 15px/1.4 'Fira Code',monospace;letter-spacing:-.03em}.placed{margin-top:2px;color:var(--ink-faint);font-size:14px}.item-line{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-top:18px;padding:13px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.item-name{font-weight:600}.item-qty{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:14px;white-space:nowrap}.order-facts{display:grid;gap:0;margin:0}.fact{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.fact dt{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:14px}.fact dd{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:0;color:var(--ink);font-size:15px;font-weight:600}.delivered-dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ok);flex:none}.order-total{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;padding-top:16px}.order-total span{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:14px}.order-total strong{font-size:22px;line-height:1.2;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.policy-note{display:grid;grid-template-columns:19px 1fr;gap:10px;margin-top:22px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.policy-note .icon{color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:2px}.policy-note strong{display:block;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4}.policy-note p{margin-top:5px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:14px;line-height:1.5}\n.conversation{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0;min-height:680px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px}.conversation-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px;padding:19px 26px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.conversation-head h2{font-size:18px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:700}.assistant-state{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:14px;font-weight:500;white-space:nowrap}.assistant-state .icon{width:17px;height:17px;font-size:17px}.thread-body{display:flex;flex:1;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:20px;min-height:0;padding:28px 32px 24px}.assistant-message{width:min(100%,700px);padding:0 0 0 16px;border-left:2px solid #d6cec3}.speaker{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:var(--ink);font-size:14px;font-weight:700}.speaker .icon{width:16px;height:16px;font-size:16px;color:var(--ink-soft)}.message-text{margin-top:10px!important;color:var(--ink);font-size:18px;line-height:1.55;max-width:62ch}.clarification-note{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:9px;width:min(100%,700px);padding:12px 14px;background:var(--surface-soft);border-radius:7px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:14px;line-height:1.45}.clarification-note .icon{width:16px;height:16px;font-size:16px;margin-top:1px;color:var(--ink-soft)}.starter-area{width:min(100%,760px);margin-top:2px}.starter-heading{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin-bottom:10px}.starter-heading strong{font-size:15px;font-weight:600}.starter-heading span{color:var(--ink-faint);font-size:13px}.starter-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px}.starter{min-height:42px;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line-strong);border-radius:7px;background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);font-size:14px;font-weight:500;text-align:left}.starter:hover{border-color:#b7aa9a;background:#fbf8f4}.composer{margin-top:auto;padding:18px 26px 22px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.composer label{display:block;margin-bottom:7px;color:var(--ink);font-size:14px;font-weight:600}.composer-row{display:flex;align-items:stretch;gap:10px}.composer textarea{display:block;flex:1;min-width:0;min-height:50px;max-height:110px;padding:13px 14px;resize:vertical;border:1px solid var(--line-strong);border-radius:8px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink);font-size:15px;line-height:1.4}.composer textarea::placeholder{color:#766f68;opacity:1}.composer textarea:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--brand);outline-offset:2px}.send-button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-width:132px;min-height:50px;padding:0 16px;border:1px solid #d9d2c9;border-radius:8px;background:#efede9;color:#817970;font-size:14px;font-weight:700}.send-button .icon{width:16px;height:16px;font-size:16px}.composer-foot{margin-top:8px;color:var(--ink-faint);font-size:13px;line-height:1.4}\n@media(max-width:1100px){.shopbar-inner{width:calc(100% - 40px);gap:16px}.shop-search{max-width:240px}.nav-link{padding:0 9px;font-size:14px}.shell{width:calc(100% - 40px)}.workspace{grid-template-columns:minmax(280px,320px) minmax(0,1fr);gap:16px}.conversation-head{padding-left:20px;padding-right:20px}.thread-body{padding:24px 22px}.composer{padding-left:20px;padding-right:20px}}\n@media(max-width:900px){.brand-copy small{display:none}.shop-search{max-width:210px}.nav-link{gap:6px;padding:0 8px}.workspace{grid-template-columns:1fr}.order-panel{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(220px,.8fr) minmax(0,1.2fr);column-gap:24px;align-items:start}.mode-toggle{grid-column:1/-1}.order-details{margin-top:18px}.policy-note{margin-top:18px}.conversation{min-height:640px}}\n@media(max-width:640px){.shopbar-inner{width:calc(100% - 28px);min-height:64px;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:10px 0}.shopbar{min-height:64px}.brand{gap:8px}.brand-mark{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:10px}.brand-copy{font-size:14px}.shop-search{display:none}.main-nav{gap:1px}.nav-link{min-width:37px;min-height:40px;padding:0 6px}.nav-label{display:none}.nav-link .icon{width:18px;height:18px}.shell{width:calc(100% - 28px);padding:23px 0 28px}.page-heading{margin-bottom:18px}.page-heading h1{font-size:27px}.page-heading p{font-size:15px}.order-panel{display:block;padding:15px}.order-details{margin-top:18px}.policy-note{margin-top:16px;padding-top:14px}.conversation{min-height:620px}.conversation-head{align-items:flex-start;padding:15px 16px}.conversation-head h2{font-size:17px}.assistant-state{font-size:13px}.assistant-state .icon{display:none}.thread-body{gap:16px;padding:20px 16px}.message-text{font-size:17px}.starter-heading{display:block}.starter-heading span{display:block;margin-top:3px}.starter-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.starter{min-height:44px}.composer{padding:14px 15px 16px}.composer-row{align-items:stretch;flex-direction:column}.composer textarea{min-height:74px}.send-button{min-height:44px;width:100%}}\n</style>\n<div class=\"scene\" data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"refund support page root\">\n    <header class=\"shopbar\" data-kid=\"1-1\" data-name=\"store top bar\">\n        <div class=\"shopbar-inner\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\" data-name=\"top bar inner container\">\n            <a aria-label=\"Refund Store home\" class=\"brand\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"store brand link\" href=\"#\">\n                <span class=\"brand-mark\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"brand logo mark\">\n                    R\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"brand-copy\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"store brand name block\">\n                    Refund Store\n                    <small data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"store tagline text\">\n                        everyday finds, clearly handled\n                    </small>\n                </span>\n            </a>\n            <div aria-label=\"Product search\" class=\"shop-search\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"product search field\" role=\"search\">\n                <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-search\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"search magnifier icon\">\n                </i>\n                <span data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"search placeholder text\">\n                    What are you looking for?\n                </span>\n            </div>\n            <nav aria-label=\"Store navigation\" class=\"main-nav\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3\" data-name=\"main store navigation\">\n                <a class=\"nav-link\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"shop navigation link\" href=\"#\">\n                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-shopping-bag\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"shopping bag nav icon\">\n                    </i>\n                    <span class=\"nav-label\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"shop nav label\">\n                        Shop\n                    </span>\n                </a>\n                <a class=\"nav-link\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3-2\" data-name=\"orders navigation link\" href=\"#\">\n                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-package\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"package nav icon\">\n                    </i>\n                    <span class=\"nav-label\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"orders nav label\">\n                        Orders\n                    </span>\n                </a>\n                <a aria-current=\"page\" class=\"nav-link active\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3-3\" data-name=\"help navigation link active\" href=\"#\">\n                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-message-square\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3-3-1\" data-name=\"message square nav icon\">\n                    </i>\n                    <span class=\"nav-label\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3-3-2\" data-name=\"help nav label\">\n                        Help\n                    </span>\n                </a>\n                <a class=\"nav-link\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3-4\" data-name=\"account navigation link\" href=\"#\">\n                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-user-round\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3-4-1\" data-name=\"user nav icon\">\n                    </i>\n                    <span class=\"nav-label\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3-4-2\" data-name=\"account nav label\">\n                        Account\n                    </span>\n                </a>\n                <a class=\"nav-link\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3-5\" data-name=\"cart navigation link\" href=\"#\">\n                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-shopping-cart\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3-5-1\" data-name=\"shopping cart nav icon\">\n                    </i>\n                    <span class=\"nav-label\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3-5-2\" data-name=\"cart nav label\">\n                        Cart\n                    </span>\n                </a>\n            </nav>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n    <main class=\"shell\" data-kid=\"1-2\" data-name=\"main page content shell\">\n        <header class=\"page-heading\" data-kid=\"1-2-1\" data-name=\"page heading section\">\n            <h1 data-kid=\"1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"page title headline\">\n                Get help with an order\n            </h1>\n            <p data-kid=\"1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"page supporting description\">\n                Tell us what went wrong. The assistant checks the written refund rules before describing an outcome.\n            </p>\n        </header>\n        <div class=\"workspace\" data-kid=\"1-2-2\" data-name=\"two-column workspace\">\n            <aside aria-label=\"Support mode and order context\" class=\"order-panel\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"order context side panel\">\n                <div aria-label=\"Assistant mode\" class=\"mode-toggle\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"assistant mode toggle group\" role=\"group\">\n                    <button aria-pressed=\"true\" class=\"mode-button selected\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"refund help mode button\" type=\"button\">\n                        Refund help\n                    </button>\n                    <button aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"mode-button\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"shopping help mode button\" type=\"button\">\n                        Shopping help\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n                <section aria-labelledby=\"order-title\" class=\"order-details\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"order details section\">\n                    <h2 data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"order section title\" id=\"order-title\">\n                        About this order\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"order-id\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"order reference id text\">\n                        ORD-DEMO-02\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"placed\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"order placed date text\">\n                        Placed 27/09/2026\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"item-line\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-4\" data-name=\"ordered item line\">\n                        <span class=\"item-name\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"item name text\">\n                            Aurora Desk Lamp\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"item-qty\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"item quantity text\">\n                            Qty 1\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <dl class=\"order-facts\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-5\" data-name=\"order facts list\">\n                        <div class=\"fact\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-5-1\" data-name=\"delivery fact row\">\n                            <dt data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-5-1-1\" data-name=\"delivery fact label\">\n                                Delivery\n                            </dt>\n                            <dd data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-5-1-2\" data-name=\"delivery status value\">\n                                <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"delivered-dot\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-5-1-2-1\" data-name=\"delivered status indicator dot\">\n                                </span>\n                                Delivered\n                            </dd>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"fact\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-5-2\" data-name=\"payment fact row\">\n                            <dt data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-5-2-1\" data-name=\"payment fact label\">\n                                Payment\n                            </dt>\n                            <dd data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-5-2-2\" data-name=\"payment status value\">\n                                Settled\n                            </dd>\n                        </div>\n                    </dl>\n                    <div class=\"order-total\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-6\" data-name=\"order total row\">\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-6-1\" data-name=\"order total label\">\n                            Total paid\n                        </span>\n                        <strong data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-6-2\" data-name=\"order total amount\">\n                            $129.00\n                        </strong>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n                <div class=\"policy-note\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-3\" data-name=\"refund policy note box\">\n                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-shield-check\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"shield check policy icon\">\n                    </i>\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-3-2\" data-name=\"policy note text container\">\n                        <strong data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"policy note heading\">\n                            How refund decisions work\n                        </strong>\n                        <p data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"policy note body text\">\n                            The written policy determines refund outcomes. A person confirms any refund before money moves.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </aside>\n            <section aria-labelledby=\"conversation-title\" class=\"conversation\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"conversation panel\">\n                <header class=\"conversation-head\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"conversation header bar\">\n                    <h2 data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"conversation title\" id=\"conversation-title\">\n                        Your conversation\n                    </h2>\n                    <span class=\"assistant-state\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"assistant status indicator\">\n                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-bot\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"assistant bot status icon\">\n                        </i>\n                        Assistant · waiting for your message\n                    </span>\n                </header>\n                <div class=\"thread-body\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"conversation message thread body\">\n                    <article class=\"assistant-message\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"assistant greeting message\">\n                        <div class=\"speaker\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"message speaker label\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-bot\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"message speaker bot icon\">\n                            </i>\n                            Refund assistant asks\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"message-text\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"assistant message text\">\n                            Tell me what went wrong with this order and I’ll check what the refund policy allows.\n                        </p>\n                    </article>\n                    <p class=\"clarification-note\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"clarification note callout\">\n                        <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-message-circle-question\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"question clarification icon\">\n                        </i>\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"clarification note text\">\n                            This is a question, not a refund decision. Share the issue so the written rules can be checked.\n                        </span>\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"starter-area\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"starter reasons area\">\n                        <div class=\"starter-heading\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"starter reasons heading row\">\n                            <strong data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"starter reasons heading text\">\n                                Choose a reason to add to your message\n                            </strong>\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"starter reasons disclaimer text\">\n                                It won’t be sent until you send it.\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div aria-label=\"Common reasons\" class=\"starter-grid\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"starter reason buttons grid\">\n                            <button class=\"starter\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"starter reason button: Arrived damaged\" type=\"button\">\n                                Arrived damaged\n                            </button>\n                            <button class=\"starter\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"starter reason button: Wrong item sent\" type=\"button\">\n                                Wrong item sent\n                            </button>\n                            <button class=\"starter\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3-2-3\" data-name=\"starter reason button: Not as described\" type=\"button\">\n                                Not as described\n                            </button>\n                            <button class=\"starter\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3-2-4\" data-name=\"starter reason button: Late delivery\" type=\"button\">\n                                Late delivery\n                            </button>\n                            <button class=\"starter\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3-2-5\" data-name=\"starter reason button: Missing from box\" type=\"button\">\n                                Missing from the box\n                            </button>\n                            <button class=\"starter\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3-2-6\" data-name=\"starter reason button: Charged twice\" type=\"button\">\n                                Charged twice\n                            </button>\n                            <button class=\"starter\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3-2-7\" data-name=\"starter reason button: Want to return\" type=\"button\">\n                                I want to return it\n                            </button>\n                            <button class=\"starter\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-3-2-8\" data-name=\"starter reason button: Something else\" type=\"button\">\n                                Something else\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <form aria-label=\"Write to the refund assistant\" class=\"composer\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"message composer form\">\n                    <label data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"message composer label\" for=\"issue-message\">\n                        Describe what went wrong\n                    </label>\n                    <div class=\"composer-row\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"composer input row\">\n                        <textarea aria-label=\"Describe what went wrong\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"issue message textarea\" id=\"issue-message\" placeholder=\"Add details about the issue…\"></textarea>\n                        <button class=\"send-button\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"send message button\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-send\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"send paper plane icon\">\n                            </i>\n                            Send message\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"composer-foot\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-3\" data-name=\"composer footer note text\">\n                        A customer agent will be identified separately if they join the conversation.\n                    </p>\n                </form>\n            </section>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n</div>\n",
